WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.870
=Episode 8=

01:36.840 --> 01:38.400
Thank you for coming all this way,

01:38.920 --> 01:40.120
Mr. Chu, to help us

01:40.400 --> 01:42.200
settle the issue

01:42.560 --> 01:43.960
with Yezhou Garrison.

01:44.710 --> 01:46.400
Please, have some tea.

01:47.280 --> 01:48.479
Don't mention it, Mr. Sun.

01:51.120 --> 01:52.880
How is the Chancellor?

01:53.400 --> 01:54.479
Master is fine,

01:55.200 --> 01:56.320
though somewhat troubled.

01:59.240 --> 02:00.120
Who dares to

02:00.360 --> 02:01.400
cause distress

02:01.520 --> 02:02.410
to the Chancellor?

02:06.560 --> 02:08.960
Could it be Xiao Jue?

02:14.600 --> 02:15.680
You're mistaken, Mr. Sun.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.680
What troubles the Chancellor

02:18.280 --> 02:19.680
is naturally the state affairs.

02:21.740 --> 02:22.600
Of course.

02:22.960 --> 02:23.800
Of course.

02:24.440 --> 02:26.000
I merely wish to share

02:26.150 --> 02:27.050
his burdens.

02:29.960 --> 02:30.890
Mr. Chu.

02:31.360 --> 02:33.680
You've traveled this great distance.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.520
I've prepared a welcoming banquet.

02:35.520 --> 02:36.360
I hope you will

02:36.360 --> 02:37.920
grace us with your presence.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.880
The guest of honor must be

02:42.560 --> 02:43.560
Commander Xiao, right?

02:45.720 --> 02:46.920
Speaking of Commander Xiao,

02:47.240 --> 02:48.079
I have

02:48.079 --> 02:50.120
so much to say.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.480
He's sent me missives

02:51.880 --> 02:53.360
since his appointment,

02:53.720 --> 02:54.640
demanding either funds

02:54.640 --> 02:55.480
or provisions.

02:55.880 --> 02:57.160
But we're having

02:57.480 --> 02:58.320
a difficult time

02:58.840 --> 03:00.120
in Yezhou.

03:01.720 --> 03:02.730
The Chancellor

03:03.000 --> 03:04.200
is fully aware

03:04.320 --> 03:05.520
of all the circumstances.

03:10.840 --> 03:13.120
What are you implying, Mr. Sun?

03:13.520 --> 03:14.880
Master resides in Yaojing.

03:15.840 --> 03:18.079
How could he know what's going on here?

03:21.160 --> 03:22.079
I misspoke.

03:22.640 --> 03:24.560
I apologize.

03:26.890 --> 03:27.780
Ding Yi.

03:28.070 --> 03:29.000
Come here.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.560
Meet Mr. Chu Zhao.

03:31.910 --> 03:32.870
Mr. Chu.

03:33.320 --> 03:34.520
This is Ding Yi.

03:34.880 --> 03:35.720
General Feihong

03:35.760 --> 03:36.920
sent him over.

03:37.540 --> 03:38.470
Greetings, Mr. Chu.

03:38.730 --> 03:39.590
General says

03:40.160 --> 03:41.120
I'm at your disposal

03:41.760 --> 03:43.160
whenever you need me.

03:44.640 --> 03:46.160
General Feihong is too kind.

03:46.570 --> 03:47.500
I don't need you

03:47.500 --> 03:48.360
for anything.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.680
Mr. Chu.

03:52.680 --> 03:53.680
Excuse me for a second.

03:53.920 --> 03:55.079
Let me check on

03:55.280 --> 03:56.240
the banquet.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.920
With two distinguished guests here,

03:58.079 --> 04:00.300
- I dare not make any mistakes.
- Indeed.

04:00.440 --> 04:01.560
Make thorough preparation.

04:02.150 --> 04:03.020
Master.

04:05.610 --> 04:06.310
Master.

04:06.440 --> 04:07.840
It's Commander Xiao and Mr. Cheng.

04:10.820 --> 04:11.560
Mr. Chu.

04:20.079 --> 04:21.279
(Sun Mansion)
What an honor, Commander.

04:21.320 --> 04:22.680
Forgive me for failing

04:22.680 --> 04:24.480
to greet you properly.

04:27.840 --> 04:29.000
Please meet the inspector,

04:29.000 --> 04:30.720
Mr. Chu Zhao.

04:31.840 --> 04:32.460
Commander Xiao.

04:32.680 --> 04:33.400
Long time no see.

04:33.720 --> 04:34.280
Mr. Chu.

04:34.960 --> 04:35.680
Long time no see.

04:41.159 --> 04:41.920
(It's him?)

04:42.880 --> 04:43.760
(Come to think of it,)

04:44.080 --> 04:45.720
(I once swindled him.)

04:46.200 --> 04:47.480
(But I did give him medicine.)

04:47.720 --> 04:48.760
(I guess we're even.)

04:49.480 --> 04:50.240
Nice to meet you.

04:50.880 --> 04:51.640
Mr. Cheng.

04:53.200 --> 04:54.000
(It looks like)

04:54.159 --> 04:55.480
(he's not going to expose me)

04:55.480 --> 04:56.440
(in public.)

04:59.200 --> 04:59.840
I am

05:00.710 --> 05:01.800
Cheng Lisu.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.000
Greetings, Inspector.

05:14.040 --> 05:14.840
What is it, Father?

05:14.840 --> 05:15.370
Ling.

05:15.520 --> 05:17.000
Apologize to Commander Xiao

05:17.040 --> 05:18.400
and Mr. Cheng.

05:24.400 --> 05:26.200
Sorry, I have offended you.

05:26.360 --> 05:27.160
Please kindly

05:27.920 --> 05:28.720
forgive me.

05:32.840 --> 05:33.560
Go on.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.120
I'm unworthy of your anger.

05:38.360 --> 05:40.440
So you realize that

05:40.560 --> 05:41.680
you're unworthy?

05:49.120 --> 05:50.680
Shall we be seated

05:51.040 --> 05:51.720
first?

05:52.159 --> 05:52.680
Commander.

05:53.320 --> 05:54.960
You need to talk to Mr. Sun.

05:55.280 --> 05:55.840
Go ahead.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.280
Please.

06:23.270 --> 06:26.250
(Peace and Harmony)

06:31.640 --> 06:32.320
Commander.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.680
You assumed

06:33.840 --> 06:35.120
your position some time ago.

06:35.360 --> 06:36.440
I haven't had the chance

06:36.560 --> 06:37.560
to pay my respects.

06:37.760 --> 06:38.600
Instead,

06:38.720 --> 06:39.960
you came to see me first.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.560
I feel so guilty.

06:42.400 --> 06:43.040
Let me

06:43.640 --> 06:44.600
toast to you.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.640
You're too kind.

06:48.240 --> 06:49.320
I don't mind visiting

06:49.360 --> 06:50.440
as long as we work out

06:50.800 --> 06:52.120
the problems of supplies

06:52.880 --> 06:53.600
and funds.

06:57.960 --> 06:59.280
Commander, your words

06:59.600 --> 07:01.880
make me burn with shame.

07:04.360 --> 07:06.040
An army without supplies perishes.

07:06.280 --> 07:06.920
That

07:07.320 --> 07:08.080
I know.

07:08.400 --> 07:09.840
I also want to handle it

07:09.920 --> 07:11.200
perfectly.

07:11.680 --> 07:12.280
It's just that

07:12.680 --> 07:14.000
our county granary has had

07:14.040 --> 07:15.600
no grain reserves for years.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.000
I truly can't

07:17.080 --> 07:18.480
raise any funds.

07:19.840 --> 07:21.360
Despite such hardships,

07:22.160 --> 07:23.280
you are still able

07:23.680 --> 07:24.680
to treat us to such

07:25.040 --> 07:26.080
lavish delicacies.

07:26.880 --> 07:27.600
Mr. Sun,

07:28.800 --> 07:29.560
you're too kind.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.159
Don't mention it.

07:33.400 --> 07:33.960
It's good

07:34.640 --> 07:36.320
that the inspector is also here.

07:36.960 --> 07:37.560
Mr. Chu,

07:38.240 --> 07:39.920
we should absolutely look into

07:40.760 --> 07:41.760
the tax ledger

07:42.680 --> 07:44.440
for the tax collection details.

07:45.200 --> 07:46.470
Was the tax left uncollected,

07:47.480 --> 07:49.080
or was there foul play?

07:56.040 --> 07:57.720
We're counting on you, Mr. Chu.

08:00.120 --> 08:00.640
Mr. Sun.

08:02.280 --> 08:02.880
I'm here.

08:03.240 --> 08:03.920
Shouldn't you

08:04.360 --> 08:05.680
toast Mr. Chu?

08:10.560 --> 08:12.120
A timely reminder, Commander.

08:12.400 --> 08:12.970
I was

08:13.360 --> 08:14.680
almost rude.

08:16.440 --> 08:16.960
Mr. Chu,

08:18.480 --> 08:19.560
here is to you.

08:19.760 --> 08:21.360
I beg your forgiveness.

08:24.120 --> 08:24.710
Ling.

08:27.560 --> 08:29.360
Please forgive me.

08:35.400 --> 08:36.360
Please don't say that.

08:36.640 --> 08:37.679
Duties take precedence.

08:38.240 --> 08:38.880
Besides,

08:39.320 --> 08:40.280
this concerns

08:40.600 --> 08:42.480
the basic welfare of the soldiers,

08:42.840 --> 08:43.919
which is the top priority.

08:44.400 --> 08:45.840
I will spare no effort

08:46.080 --> 08:47.840
in fulfilling my inspection duties.

08:48.560 --> 08:50.080
Thank you, Mr. Chu.

08:53.560 --> 08:54.520
We appreciate it.

08:59.280 --> 09:00.600
Enough of unpleasant talks.

09:01.360 --> 09:01.880
I will stay

09:02.320 --> 09:03.920
at your mansion for a few days.

09:04.280 --> 09:04.800
I hope

09:05.200 --> 09:06.800
I won't ruin your mood, Mr. Sun.

09:08.000 --> 09:08.920
Not at all.

09:09.640 --> 09:11.360
It's my honor

09:11.720 --> 09:13.880
to have you reside here.

09:16.760 --> 09:18.120
To complement this occasion,

09:18.480 --> 09:19.040
I have

09:19.200 --> 09:20.560
prepared a little show

09:20.840 --> 09:21.440
to enhance

09:21.600 --> 09:22.160
festivities.

09:36.990 --> 09:38.380
(Peace and Harmony)

09:40.560 --> 09:42.320
(That man visited the Wanhua Pavilion)

09:43.080 --> 09:44.400
(to select dancers.)

11:05.600 --> 11:06.160
Someone.

11:06.560 --> 11:08.720
Bring forth my aged vintage

11:08.720 --> 11:09.240
from storage.

11:09.520 --> 11:11.240
Let our guests sample it.

11:34.120 --> 11:34.760
Commander.

11:35.520 --> 11:36.160
Mr. Cheng.

11:36.680 --> 11:38.000
Let me toast you both.

11:38.640 --> 11:39.280
Bottoms up.

11:57.960 --> 11:58.720
Uncle, I toast you.

12:02.280 --> 12:02.920
Uncle.

12:03.200 --> 12:03.840
It's poisoned.

12:03.920 --> 12:05.000
This wine is poisoned.

12:08.620 --> 12:09.290
I...

12:09.520 --> 12:10.400
I had no idea.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.240
Guards.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.400
Oh my! Help!

12:17.520 --> 12:19.120
Oh my! Assassins!

12:19.960 --> 12:21.240
Assassins!

12:24.600 --> 12:25.160
Sun Xiangfu.

12:25.280 --> 12:26.360
Summon the guards.

12:26.880 --> 12:27.760
Guards.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.240
Guards.

12:29.680 --> 12:30.520
Didn't you hear us?

12:30.960 --> 12:31.720
Guards.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.080
Are you dead?

12:47.880 --> 12:48.440
Watch out.

13:01.360 --> 13:02.200
Help.

13:05.900 --> 13:06.800
Help me.

13:15.080 --> 13:15.720
Help.

13:37.240 --> 13:37.770
Uncle.

14:25.400 --> 14:26.160
Guards.

14:26.400 --> 14:27.480
Get the corpses out.

14:28.920 --> 14:29.640
Wait.

14:34.720 --> 14:35.320
Uncle.

14:38.480 --> 14:39.240
I think

14:39.480 --> 14:40.400
I've gone blind.

15:08.080 --> 15:09.120
Assassins

15:09.920 --> 15:11.000
and poisoned wine?

15:13.520 --> 15:15.000
Any explanations?

15:19.320 --> 15:19.850
Commander.

15:20.480 --> 15:22.310
I swear I have no idea

15:22.310 --> 15:23.960
what happened here.

15:24.720 --> 15:25.520
I know nothing

15:25.640 --> 15:26.640
about the poison, either.

15:30.720 --> 15:32.920
This happened in your mansion.

15:35.560 --> 15:36.880
But your people

15:36.880 --> 15:38.320
act completely innocent.

15:39.360 --> 15:40.520
Isn't it ridiculous?

15:44.360 --> 15:45.480
We don't know the dancers

15:45.720 --> 15:46.760
and musicians.

15:47.080 --> 15:48.080
They were hired.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.260
Kneel.

15:53.560 --> 15:54.240
- I...
- Kneel.

15:54.760 --> 15:55.320
Kneel.

15:55.960 --> 15:56.640
No matter what,

15:57.000 --> 15:59.280
as head of the Sun family,

15:59.720 --> 16:00.760
I failed to protect you

16:01.360 --> 16:02.640
due to my negligence

16:02.960 --> 16:04.400
and nearly caused a catastrophe.

16:04.680 --> 16:06.320
I await your punishment, Commander.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.200
Are you saying

16:12.800 --> 16:14.440
that we should let this matter drop?

16:14.920 --> 16:15.400
I dare not.

16:15.640 --> 16:17.960
I'll get to the bottom of this.

16:18.640 --> 16:20.480
All assassins took poison

16:21.040 --> 16:22.120
and dropped dead.

16:22.640 --> 16:23.760
I'm not leaving until

16:24.200 --> 16:25.040
I find the truth.

16:25.640 --> 16:26.760
I'll help you investigate,

16:27.320 --> 16:28.280
Mr. Sun.

16:31.520 --> 16:32.840
Commander Xiao is right.

16:33.680 --> 16:34.800
As a witness,

16:35.120 --> 16:35.960
I'm also obligated

16:36.320 --> 16:37.160
to uncover the truth

16:37.600 --> 16:38.720
and catch the culprit.

16:43.960 --> 16:45.120
I appreciate it, Inspector.

17:05.560 --> 17:06.400
How do you feel?

17:07.680 --> 17:08.720
It's hurting less.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.000
I'm just not used to it.

17:15.079 --> 17:15.599
Earlier,

17:16.160 --> 17:16.920
I requested

17:16.920 --> 17:18.000
some soothing cream.

17:18.839 --> 17:19.720
It should arrive soon.

17:21.760 --> 17:22.280
Commander.

17:22.680 --> 17:23.640
Don't worry about me.

17:30.920 --> 17:31.520
Xiao Jue.

17:32.640 --> 17:34.320
Are you feeling sorry for me?

17:38.240 --> 17:39.480
Maybe you even feel guilty.

17:40.040 --> 17:41.040
But actually,

17:41.520 --> 17:42.560
you should praise me.

17:43.840 --> 17:44.600
For what?

17:45.640 --> 17:47.080
For being remarkable, obviously.

17:47.720 --> 17:48.400
If I hadn't

17:48.480 --> 17:49.840
stopped you from having the wine,

17:50.120 --> 17:51.360
you'd be dead now.

17:51.840 --> 17:53.400
I'm basically your lifesaver.

17:53.760 --> 17:54.800
Isn't that impressive?

17:58.480 --> 17:59.760
You don't seem distressed

18:01.080 --> 18:02.360
about losing your sight.

18:03.760 --> 18:05.840
Possibly forever.

18:15.000 --> 18:15.880
(She's scared.)

18:17.560 --> 18:18.720
(She's not as casual)

18:18.720 --> 18:19.520
(as she appears.)

18:22.480 --> 18:23.780
The blind aren't all the same.

18:24.520 --> 18:25.600
With my capabilities,

18:26.880 --> 18:27.920
I'll surely become

18:28.320 --> 18:28.880
the most

18:28.880 --> 18:30.000
formidable blind person.

18:38.040 --> 18:38.800
What

18:39.600 --> 18:41.120
happened tonight?

18:42.880 --> 18:43.720
Did you

18:43.720 --> 18:44.920
plot all this?

18:51.720 --> 18:52.400
Well...

18:53.040 --> 18:55.080
How can you be such a fool?

18:56.080 --> 18:56.720
And you.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.920
How dare you act so recklessly?

19:01.720 --> 19:02.360
What should I

19:02.400 --> 19:03.440
tell General Feihong?

19:06.600 --> 19:07.200
Unless

19:08.840 --> 19:10.680
he sent you here exactly for this.

19:16.600 --> 19:17.680
Please, Mr. Chu.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.720
Though we acted on our own,

19:20.000 --> 19:20.760
it was solely

19:20.760 --> 19:22.120
for the Chancellor's sake.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.370
You see.

19:23.640 --> 19:24.640
Everyone here knows

19:24.760 --> 19:26.000
that I work for the Chancellor.

19:26.200 --> 19:26.960
Xiao Jue came

19:27.040 --> 19:28.000
and humiliated me.

19:28.280 --> 19:29.400
He's not coming after me.

19:29.560 --> 19:30.720
He's after Mr. Xu!

19:30.720 --> 19:31.320
Mr. Sun.

19:37.400 --> 19:39.120
Your arrogance astounds me.

19:40.080 --> 19:41.000
Yezhou barely contains

19:41.040 --> 19:42.040
your inflated ego.

19:47.240 --> 19:48.640
Please forgive me.

19:53.960 --> 19:55.200
I don't care

19:55.880 --> 19:57.040
what you do.

19:57.760 --> 19:58.310
Anyway,

19:59.080 --> 20:00.840
if Master's reputation suffers damage,

20:01.200 --> 20:02.160
both you and I

20:02.880 --> 20:04.000
will be held accountable.

20:04.760 --> 20:05.440
It won't happen.

20:08.000 --> 20:08.600
Rest assured.

20:08.920 --> 20:09.680
Xiao Jue will not

20:09.760 --> 20:11.160
leave Yezhou alive.

20:11.560 --> 20:12.920
I dare not cause the Chancellor

20:13.000 --> 20:14.040
any trouble.

20:14.720 --> 20:16.320
I will make sure there are

20:17.400 --> 20:18.320
no loose ends.

20:25.040 --> 20:25.960
Take care, Mr. Chu.

20:39.320 --> 20:40.160
We underestimated

20:40.280 --> 20:41.920
Xiao Jue's martial prowess.

20:42.600 --> 20:44.280
And that Cheng Lisu...

20:45.240 --> 20:46.680
He spilled the wine

20:47.280 --> 20:49.200
way too conveniently.

20:51.320 --> 20:52.840
I think I have

20:54.920 --> 20:56.680
seen him somewhere.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.280
Commander.

21:06.200 --> 21:07.240
Won't you look into

21:07.520 --> 21:08.800
the assassination?

21:09.720 --> 21:10.520
How did assassins

21:10.840 --> 21:12.280
infiltrate the Sun Mansion?

21:12.560 --> 21:14.720
Are the Suns truly innocent?

21:16.240 --> 21:17.880
I came to ask for military funding

21:18.600 --> 21:20.120
and consolidate control over

21:20.240 --> 21:21.280
officials and merchants.

21:21.960 --> 21:22.600
I can't

21:23.200 --> 21:24.240
confront the Sun family

21:24.320 --> 21:24.960
just yet.

21:26.850 --> 21:28.770
(Great Virtue)

21:41.760 --> 21:42.280
Don't move.

21:53.850 --> 21:59.940
♪Constant yearning,
still vivid as our first meeting♪

22:00.970 --> 22:04.640
♪Endless gazing.
Step by step, falling deeper♪

22:04.640 --> 22:05.280
Does it hurt?

22:06.840 --> 22:07.370
No.

22:07.560 --> 22:08.200
I'm used to it.

22:11.000 --> 22:12.200
Just hand me the cup.

22:16.630 --> 22:21.950
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

22:22.840 --> 22:26.660
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

22:26.950 --> 22:29.960
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

22:30.920 --> 22:31.480
Have it.

22:34.200 --> 22:34.760
Not thirsty?

22:37.350 --> 22:41.450
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

22:41.450 --> 22:44.970
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

22:46.410 --> 22:52.520
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

23:00.320 --> 23:00.840
Are you cold?

23:03.520 --> 23:04.080
Not really.

23:05.040 --> 23:05.880
It's just that

23:06.240 --> 23:07.640
you're suddenly so nice to me.

23:08.040 --> 23:09.320
It's giving me goosebumps.

23:11.300 --> 23:17.030
♪Shadows hustle. Scenes reappear♪

23:18.480 --> 23:19.040
I'll...

23:20.680 --> 23:21.560
I'll go lie down.

23:26.600 --> 23:31.120
♪Through endless dawns and dusks,
to eternity♪

23:31.120 --> 23:32.480
I got this.

23:33.100 --> 23:36.780
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

23:36.940 --> 23:39.780
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

23:40.230 --> 23:47.210
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

23:47.300 --> 23:51.640
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

23:51.640 --> 23:55.430
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

23:55.980 --> 24:02.120
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

24:02.410 --> 24:06.470
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

24:06.600 --> 24:09.390
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

24:09.990 --> 24:16.320
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

24:16.320 --> 24:16.880
Mind the step.

24:16.880 --> 24:20.910
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

24:20.910 --> 24:24.520
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

24:25.740 --> 24:31.530
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

24:35.240 --> 24:35.760
Rest now.

24:36.520 --> 24:37.360
I'll be right here

24:37.840 --> 24:38.480
for you.

24:49.280 --> 24:50.440
As you said, Commander,

24:50.920 --> 24:52.480
the assassination must be linked

24:52.600 --> 24:53.440
to Sun Xiangfu.

24:54.040 --> 24:55.080
And the servant was

24:55.280 --> 24:56.080
highly suspicious.

24:56.920 --> 24:57.450
That's right.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.000
This is our chance

24:59.120 --> 25:00.080
to infiltrate them

25:00.800 --> 25:01.480
and get to

25:02.600 --> 25:04.240
the bottom of everything.

25:05.000 --> 25:06.720
I discovered a hidden chamber here

25:07.160 --> 25:08.080
last time.

25:08.720 --> 25:09.640
The tax ledger

25:09.680 --> 25:10.680
is likely hidden there.

25:11.440 --> 25:12.320
But I was in a rush

25:12.480 --> 25:13.360
and the chamber was

25:14.520 --> 25:15.400
heavily guarded, so...

25:15.760 --> 25:16.320
It's fine.

25:16.960 --> 25:18.080
Since we are living here,

25:18.920 --> 25:20.000
we'll find a chance.

25:21.400 --> 25:22.360
But He Yan

25:23.160 --> 25:24.320
was implicated.

25:53.040 --> 25:55.320
(Xiao Jue is even more of a trouble
than I imagined,)

25:56.040 --> 25:57.360
(closing in step by step.)

25:58.920 --> 26:00.800
(We must hide the tax ledger well.)

26:02.050 --> 26:02.600
(Tax Ledger)

26:02.600 --> 26:03.880
(If Xiao Jue figures out)

26:03.960 --> 26:05.480
(that the tax records)

26:05.480 --> 26:06.520
(are falsified,)

26:06.680 --> 26:08.240
(we're finished.)

26:25.380 --> 26:26.570
(Account Book)

26:27.080 --> 26:29.360
(My life depends on this.)

26:41.080 --> 26:42.680
(As long as I hold on to this,)

26:43.080 --> 26:44.520
(Mr. Xu won't let anything)

26:44.520 --> 26:45.640
(happen to me.)

26:47.000 --> 26:47.760
(Otherwise,)

26:49.000 --> 26:50.600
(I'll drag him down with me.)

26:58.240 --> 26:59.840
(How dare Chu Zhao)

26:59.920 --> 27:02.680
(boss me around, acting arrogantly?)

27:02.800 --> 27:04.400
(I must remind him.)

27:05.760 --> 27:06.800
That he himself

27:07.880 --> 27:10.320
is merely another one of Mr. Xu's

27:11.480 --> 27:13.120
lackeys.

27:23.800 --> 27:25.400
Have some porridge.

27:32.160 --> 27:32.880
Thank you, Uncle.

27:33.400 --> 27:34.240
You've worked hard.

27:35.200 --> 27:36.240
I don't mind taking care

27:37.080 --> 27:37.680
of my nephew.

27:38.760 --> 27:40.080
Then could you please

27:40.320 --> 27:41.360
get me some side dishes

27:41.520 --> 27:42.440
for the porridge?

27:48.040 --> 27:48.840
And perhaps some

27:49.640 --> 27:50.520
family discipline.

27:51.880 --> 27:52.400
Open up.

27:55.560 --> 27:56.080
Commander.

27:56.920 --> 27:57.440
Mr. Cheng.

27:58.250 --> 27:58.880
This is

27:59.080 --> 27:59.760
our most famous

27:59.760 --> 28:00.640
and best oculist

28:00.920 --> 28:01.960
in Yezhou.

28:05.120 --> 28:06.440
Physician, you're finally here.

28:07.120 --> 28:08.200
This morning,

28:08.320 --> 28:10.000
I had cassia seeds

28:10.080 --> 28:11.000
with white peony root.

28:11.280 --> 28:12.320
I feel much better now.

28:12.560 --> 28:13.360
Please examine me.

28:13.760 --> 28:14.320
Good.

28:14.960 --> 28:16.840
Cassia seeds do improve vision.

28:17.640 --> 28:18.200
But still,

28:18.360 --> 28:19.240
let me

28:19.600 --> 28:21.400
examine you properly.

29:05.720 --> 29:06.520
(She can see?)

29:12.560 --> 29:13.120
Physician.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.120
We're both physicians.

29:15.600 --> 29:18.000
While cassia seeds improve vision,

29:18.440 --> 29:19.800
combining with white peony roots

29:20.080 --> 29:21.440
causes abdominal discomfort.

29:24.560 --> 29:25.720
As a physician,

29:26.160 --> 29:27.600
surely you know this?

29:32.720 --> 29:34.120
You're right, Mr. Cheng.

29:34.560 --> 29:35.160
I am

29:35.520 --> 29:36.480
getting senile

29:36.760 --> 29:37.480
and confused.

29:38.240 --> 29:39.720
I almost made a grave mistake.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.040
It's alright.

29:41.480 --> 29:42.840
Just prescribe me something

29:42.920 --> 29:43.960
more effective.

29:45.000 --> 29:45.680
But

29:45.680 --> 29:46.680
make it less bitter.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.080
Do as he says.

29:50.520 --> 29:51.760
Alright.

30:10.880 --> 30:12.160
(That powder was strong.)

30:13.040 --> 30:14.080
(I did lose my vision)

30:14.480 --> 30:15.640
(when it got into my eyes.)

30:17.080 --> 30:17.840
(Without the drug)

30:17.840 --> 30:18.720
(Master left me,)

30:19.360 --> 30:20.680
(I'd be blind again.)

30:22.440 --> 30:23.800
(Since they think I'm blind,)

30:24.560 --> 30:25.760
(I'll play along)

30:26.480 --> 30:27.720
(to lower their guard)

30:28.400 --> 30:29.720
(for our plan.)

30:31.400 --> 30:32.160
(After all,)

30:33.080 --> 30:34.800
(nobody guards against a blind person.)

30:55.680 --> 30:56.720
(Let's see how long)

30:57.920 --> 30:59.080
(you'll keep this act.)

31:03.560 --> 31:04.120
(Did he)

31:04.680 --> 31:06.400
(notice something?)

31:14.160 --> 31:15.280
Brewing medicine takes time.

31:15.760 --> 31:16.480
Go get some air.

31:19.440 --> 31:20.040
Alright.

31:23.560 --> 31:24.520
Proxy kill was my plan.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.160
Too bad the proxy's an idiot.

31:27.040 --> 31:28.080
Now the enemy is alerted.

31:28.400 --> 31:29.160
Time's running out.

31:29.640 --> 31:31.200
Locate the hidden ledger of Sun Xiangfu

31:31.560 --> 31:33.000
and Master's dealings quickly.

31:33.700 --> 31:34.310
Understood.

31:36.800 --> 31:37.400
Mind the step.

31:42.050 --> 31:43.560
(Peace and Prosperity)

31:56.040 --> 31:57.160
It hurts!

32:02.160 --> 32:04.080
Commander's waist is indeed slender.

32:06.520 --> 32:07.400
That's enough.

32:11.400 --> 32:11.920
Uncle.

32:12.040 --> 32:13.280
Where are we going?

32:14.480 --> 32:15.640
Would I abandon you?

32:16.640 --> 32:17.560
Just follow me.

32:42.080 --> 32:42.600
Uncle?

32:43.920 --> 32:44.600
Uncle.

32:46.480 --> 32:47.160
Uncle!

32:51.280 --> 32:52.560
Unbelievable!

32:52.840 --> 32:54.200
He actually left me alone.

33:02.960 --> 33:04.200
Hey! Someone!

33:04.400 --> 33:05.720
I can't see.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.600
I'm blind. I'm lost.

33:07.600 --> 33:08.360
Hey! Help!

33:08.480 --> 33:09.360
Where am I?

33:10.400 --> 33:11.520
What is this place?

33:11.680 --> 33:12.360
No entry here.

33:12.440 --> 33:13.000
W-Who are you?

33:13.000 --> 33:13.600
Go back now.

33:14.040 --> 33:15.120
Why are you pulling me?

33:15.680 --> 33:16.600
Do you know who I am?

33:16.640 --> 33:17.680
Why are you pulling me?

33:17.720 --> 33:18.480
Let go.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.240
Stop pulling me.

33:21.600 --> 33:23.800
I'm blind. You're bullying me.

33:25.200 --> 33:26.440
I'm lost.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.240
Take me back, will you?

33:30.480 --> 33:32.080
Find my uncle.

33:53.880 --> 33:55.280
(The top part's way smoother)

33:55.280 --> 33:56.120
(than the rest.)

33:57.120 --> 33:59.200
(Someone touches it very often.)

35:19.840 --> 35:21.280
Let go. I can walk.

35:21.440 --> 35:21.960
Young Master.

35:22.240 --> 35:22.840
Get lost.

35:23.760 --> 35:24.520
Why should I

35:24.600 --> 35:25.400
visit Xiao Jue?

35:25.720 --> 35:26.560
I'm not going.

35:26.960 --> 35:28.240
I'd rather go to sleep.

35:29.280 --> 35:29.640
(Oh no.)

35:29.840 --> 35:30.600
(Sun Ling is back.)

35:35.240 --> 35:36.760
(The mechanism is so complex.)

35:37.560 --> 35:38.800
(It only opens if I pull)

35:38.960 --> 35:40.040
(the copper strips)

35:40.080 --> 35:40.920
(in the right order.)

35:41.680 --> 35:42.680
(A single mistake)

35:43.360 --> 35:44.880
(might destroy what's in there.)

35:51.140 --> 35:53.320
(Fortune and Blessing)

35:53.600 --> 35:54.040
I...

35:54.320 --> 35:55.200
I can walk.

35:55.360 --> 35:56.000
I'm going back.

35:56.440 --> 35:57.360
I-I remember.

35:57.560 --> 35:57.920
This way.

35:57.920 --> 35:58.400
Stop.

35:58.680 --> 35:59.040
No way.

35:59.040 --> 35:59.880
What do you mean?

36:00.000 --> 36:01.600
My room's over there.

36:01.720 --> 36:02.720
Why's it so messy?

36:02.800 --> 36:03.960
Let go.

36:04.680 --> 36:05.200
This way.

36:05.360 --> 36:06.400
Someone was in my room.

36:07.000 --> 36:07.760
Let me go.

36:09.400 --> 36:10.640
Stop pushing me.

36:28.360 --> 36:29.680
That old man is so annoying,

36:29.840 --> 36:31.240
hiding his stuff in my room

36:31.440 --> 36:32.760
and barging in uninvited.

36:33.760 --> 36:35.160
I swear I'll move out.

36:36.360 --> 36:37.640
I'm the guest of honor

36:37.800 --> 36:39.240
your master invited.

36:39.440 --> 36:40.680
Alright, Cheng Lisu.

36:40.960 --> 36:42.400
We'll settle all our scores now.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.400
Let me go.

36:47.600 --> 36:48.960
They're killing me.

36:49.160 --> 36:50.800
The servants are killing me.

36:50.960 --> 36:52.200
Why are you pushing me?

36:52.400 --> 36:53.360
You trying to kill me?

36:53.560 --> 36:54.440
Now I'm "pushing".

36:54.920 --> 36:55.600
Got it?

36:58.840 --> 37:00.960
I thought it was someone unworthy,

37:01.560 --> 37:03.680
but it's Young Master Sun.

37:04.640 --> 37:05.240
- Stop!
- You...

37:07.640 --> 37:08.200
Mr. Chu.

37:09.120 --> 37:10.000
Is this how you

37:10.000 --> 37:10.880
treat your guests?

37:12.160 --> 37:13.080
Inspector.

37:13.800 --> 37:14.360
You okay?

37:15.040 --> 37:15.880
Everything's fine.

37:16.200 --> 37:17.000
A misunderstanding.

37:17.240 --> 37:18.320
I saw Mr. Cheng

37:18.400 --> 37:19.040
struggling

37:19.520 --> 37:20.600
and tried to help.

37:21.040 --> 37:22.840
But I was too rough

37:23.440 --> 37:24.720
and ended up hurting him.

37:25.600 --> 37:26.600
Since you hurt him

37:26.600 --> 37:27.440
by mistake,

37:27.920 --> 37:29.160
you should apologize

37:29.600 --> 37:30.360
to Mr. Cheng.

37:32.360 --> 37:33.200
Of course.

37:37.280 --> 37:38.480
My apologies.

37:39.160 --> 37:41.080
Mr. Cheng, I hope you could

37:41.720 --> 37:42.480
forgive me.

37:45.200 --> 37:47.160
For the inspector's sake,

37:47.600 --> 37:48.760
I'll let it slide.

37:49.920 --> 37:51.040
Since you talked it out,

37:51.800 --> 37:53.600
I'll walk Mr. Cheng back.

37:54.240 --> 37:55.400
I appreciate it, Inspector.

37:55.910 --> 37:56.580
This way.

38:01.560 --> 38:02.120
Alright.

38:02.860 --> 38:03.460
Let's go.

38:14.440 --> 38:14.960
Be careful.

38:24.000 --> 38:24.560
Are you okay?

38:25.040 --> 38:25.640
I'm fine.

38:25.920 --> 38:26.680
I'm fine.

38:27.040 --> 38:28.440
I just stumbled a bit.

38:29.160 --> 38:29.680
Inspector.

38:30.000 --> 38:31.160
I can walk by myself.

38:31.560 --> 38:32.170
See?

38:34.280 --> 38:35.200
I can manage.

38:39.400 --> 38:39.960
I thought

38:40.000 --> 38:41.120
you'd be more casual,

38:41.520 --> 38:42.960
but you really observe propriety.

38:44.360 --> 38:45.120
As the saying goes,

38:45.520 --> 38:46.440
"A noble man

38:47.280 --> 38:49.200
conducts himself
with unwavering integrity

38:49.640 --> 38:50.520
and propriety."

38:53.360 --> 38:54.480
Careful, steps ahead.

38:54.820 --> 38:55.430
Alright.

38:55.760 --> 38:56.400
I got this.

39:02.210 --> 39:07.210
(Great Virtue)

39:07.210 --> 39:07.760
We're here.

39:09.000 --> 39:09.520
Inspector.

39:09.830 --> 39:10.440
Come in.

39:20.040 --> 39:20.560
Be careful.

39:21.400 --> 39:21.930
I'm fine.

39:22.480 --> 39:23.050
I'm fine.

39:27.120 --> 39:28.360
Suit yourself, Inspector.

39:36.040 --> 39:36.600
Let me.

39:43.760 --> 39:44.960
"Inspector" sounds

39:46.000 --> 39:46.920
way too distant.

39:49.120 --> 39:50.640
In that case,

39:51.080 --> 39:52.000
I'll boldly

39:52.160 --> 39:53.400
address you as Mr. Chu.

39:53.840 --> 39:54.400
Very good.

39:57.840 --> 39:58.680
Thank you, Mr. Chu.

39:59.200 --> 40:00.400
Where does that come from?

40:03.560 --> 40:04.880
Some things transcend words.

40:05.280 --> 40:06.920
I bet you understand. Mr. Chu.

40:08.880 --> 40:09.720
If you say so,

40:10.200 --> 40:11.520
then I suppose I do.

40:15.280 --> 40:15.880
Mr. Chu.

40:19.920 --> 40:21.680
Mr. Sun would like to see you.

40:24.760 --> 40:26.240
Attend to your duties, Mr. Chu.

40:29.600 --> 40:30.480
Rest well.

40:55.070 --> 40:57.220
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:57.330 --> 41:01.250
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

41:01.420 --> 41:03.370
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

41:03.460 --> 41:08.390
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:20.490 --> 41:21.890
♪I've seen the mountains♪

41:22.090 --> 41:23.510
♪And trodden through ice♪

41:23.780 --> 41:26.590
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

41:26.900 --> 41:28.290
♪Destiny is my creed♪

41:28.350 --> 41:29.750
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

41:29.890 --> 41:31.690
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:32.890 --> 41:34.360
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:34.530 --> 41:35.820
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:35.990 --> 41:38.390
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

41:38.580 --> 41:40.630
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:41.770 --> 41:43.600
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:45.560 --> 41:48.480
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:48.570 --> 41:51.230
♪There must always be a longing♪

41:51.680 --> 41:56.750
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

41:57.080 --> 41:59.090
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

41:59.400 --> 42:03.050
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:03.290 --> 42:05.180
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:05.210 --> 42:09.060
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:09.410 --> 42:11.350
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

42:11.530 --> 42:15.350
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

42:15.610 --> 42:21.360
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

42:22.250 --> 42:27.720
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

42:34.870 --> 42:37.790
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

42:37.880 --> 42:40.550
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:41.000 --> 42:46.060
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:46.390 --> 42:48.400
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:48.720 --> 42:52.360
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:52.600 --> 42:54.490
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:54.520 --> 42:58.370
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:58.720 --> 43:00.660
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

43:00.840 --> 43:04.670
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

43:04.920 --> 43:10.680
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

43:11.570 --> 43:17.030
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪
